   push, while the integrating agent follows the repository publication policy.
4. Check referenced files exist in a fresh checkout and instructions do not
   accidentally authorize privileged actions beyond the user's request.

Done when: a less capable agent can find the correct instructions, understand
role boundaries, and work from a clean checkout without untracked dependencies.

Completed (2026-09-27): recorded the vendored upstream URL, MIT license, initial
